#: src/shell/qml/SettingsPage.qml:159
msgid ""
"Experimental. Needs NetworkManager, its dnsmasq package and Bluetooth. While "
"on, this computer is visible over Bluetooth to devices in range, and its Wi-"
"Fi connection may drop while the hotspot is active. See the documentation."
msgstr ""
"Experimenteel. Vereist NetworkManager, het bijbehorende dnsmasq-pakket en "
"Bluetooth. Zolang dit aan staat, is deze computer via Bluetooth zichtbaar "
"voor apparaten binnen bereik en kan de wifi-verbinding wegvallen terwijl de "
"hotspot actief is. Zie de documentatie."

